00:01:33,006 --> 00:01:37,910
So what can we say about helping people to lose weight?

40
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:42,400
There's a lot we could say about what restaurants could do to reduce obesity.

41
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,200
I read that the items at the start of a menu

42
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:48,764
and the items at the end of a menu are much more likely to

43
00:01:48,764 --> 00:01:50,800
be chosen than the items in the middle.

44
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:54,552
So, if you put the low-calorie items at the beginning

45
00:01:54,552 --> 00:01:59,804
